{"unit_id":"tag:07A5:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。范畴（category）<MATH_0002> 是 Grothendieck 阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）：它具有所有余极限（colimits），滤过余极限（filtered colimits）正合（exact），并具有生成对象（generator），即\n<MATH_0003>\n见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》第 <REF_0001> 节以及引理 <REF_0002> 和 <REF_0003>。由《内射对象（Injectives）》定理 <REF_0004>，对每个复形（complex）<MATH_0004>（由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成），存在单射的（injective）拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，到一个 K-内射（injective）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成；而且此嵌入（embedding）可选为关于 <MATH_0008> 函子性的（functorial）。由《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0005> 得出：\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> 任意正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0009>，映入三角的（trianguated）范畴（category）<MATH_0010>，都有右导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0011>，\n<STRUCT_0004> 对任意加性的（additive）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0012>\n映入阿贝尔范畴（abelian category）<MATH_0013>，考虑正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0014>，由 <MATH_0015> 诱导，从而得到右导出函子（derived functor）<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n由构造，有 <MATH_0017>，其中 <MATH_0018> 如上。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n以下是上述构造的一些例子：\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009> 函子（functor）<MATH_0019> 给出\n<MATH_0020>\n我们将使用记号（notation）<MATH_0021> 表示上同调（cohomology）。\n<STRUCT_0010> 对对象（object）<MATH_0022>（属于 <MATH_0023>），考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0024>。这给出\n<MATH_0025>\n我们将使用记号（notation）<MATH_0026> 表示上同调（cohomology）。\n<STRUCT_0011> 对赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）\n<MATH_0027>\n考虑函子（functor）\n<MATH_0028>\n它给出全直像（direct image）\n<MATH_0029>\n作用在无界（unbounded）导出范畴（derived categories）上。\n<STRUCT_0012>\n\n","allowed_english":["Grothendieck","K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"generator","target_term":"生成对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性的"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"trianguated","target_term":"三角的"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"direct image","target_term":"全直像"},{"source_term":"unbounded","target_term":"无界"},{"source_term":"derived categories","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"模范畴及目标范畴"},{"source_term":"abelian category","target_term":"阿贝尔范畴","context":"模范畴及目标范畴"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"Grothendieck 范畴性质"},{"source_term":"filtered colimits","target_term":"滤过余极限","context":"模范畴滤过余极限"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"余极限和函子性质"},{"source_term":"generator","target_term":"生成对象","context":"模范畴的生成对象"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"给定及内射分解复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"分解映射单射性"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"内射分解映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射复形"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入","context":"函子性分解嵌入"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性的","context":"嵌入的函子性"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出构造的输入函子"},{"source_term":"trianguated","target_term":"三角的","context":"原文拼写 trianguated 的三角范畴"},{"source_term":"derived functor","target_term":"右导出函子","context":"无界右导出函子"},{"source_term":"additive","target_term":"加性的","context":"输入函子加性"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号","context":"上同调记号"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"无界复形上同调"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"直像对应的态射"},{"source_term":"direct image","target_term":"全直像","context":"无界导出直像"},{"source_term":"unbounded","target_term":"无界","context":"导出范畴的有界性"},{"source_term":"derived categories","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"无界导出范畴"}],"notes":["原文 trianguated 为拼写问题，双语记录保留该处英文拼写；未改动来源。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPI:proof","translation":"使用 K-平坦（K-flat）分解（resolutions）和 K-内射（injective）分解（resolutions）的存在，见引理 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003> 及上文讨论。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）\n<MATH_0001>\n其中 <MATH_0002> 作为 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）的复形（complex）为 K-内射（injective）的。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成，各项（terms）平坦（flat）。可选取 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成，记为 <MATH_0008>，各项（terms）平坦（flat），并选取复形（complexes）的态射（morphisms）的图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0009>\n在同伦（homotopy）意义下可交换（commutative），其中顶部水平的（horizontal）箭头（arrow）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。具体而言，可先为某个复形（complex）<MATH_0010> 选取这样的图式（diagram），因为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）在复形（complexes）的同伦范畴（homotopy category）中构成乘法系（multiplicative system）；然后可选取 <MATH_0011> 的分解（resolution），由 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex）给出，各项（terms）平坦（flat）。取拉回（pullbacks），得到复形（complexes）的态射（morphisms）的图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0012>\n在同伦（homotopy）意义下可交换（commutative）。外部矩形（rectangle）见证了本引理陈述的正确性。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平的"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"homotopy category","target_term":"同伦范畴"},{"source_term":"multiplicative system","target_term":"乘法系"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"rectangle","target_term":"矩形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解性质"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解","context":"两类分解"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射复形与分解"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"分解及图式箭头"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"分解复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"分解各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项性质"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"图式对象及同伦范畴对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"复形态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"分解比较图式"},{"source_term":"homotopy","target_term":"同伦","context":"同伦意义下交换"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"可交换","context":"图式